{"type":"message","id":"2a3203d0","parentId":"5663dc3d","timestamp":"2026-03-14T05:11:44.620Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-03-14 13:11 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 作为打探小弟，请搜索以下问题的答案：\n\n\"AI Agent 如何遵守规则、避免自己直接干活，而应该委派给 Subagent？\"\n\n使用 kimi_search.js 工具进行搜索，搜索关键词：\n- \"AI Agent delegation subagent best practices\"\n- \"如何避免 AI 自己直接执行任务\"\n- \"AI agent 委派任务给 subagent\"\n\n返回搜索结果摘要，包括：\n1. 为什么 AI 应该委派而不是自己执行\n2. 什么情况下应该委派\n3. 如何确保遵守这个规则\n\n请使用 kimi_search.js 工具进行搜索，并返回详细的搜索结果。"}],"timestamp":1773465104618}}
